        },
        {
          "title": "Find them on the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Press Back to close the pane. They show on your map by name, as a friendly marker that moves with them.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3267adfb5466ef69.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See where it comes from",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the marker, then the details button in its radial menu. Scroll to <strong>Remarks</strong>, which says it was shared in Matrix.</p>",
          "images": [
